meta_spec:
  id: LLM-STATE-HANDOVER-v2.3
  obj: Lossless 1-msg domain state handover (HW/ISA, SW, research) with O(1) lookup and 0 matrix math.
  rules:
    self_govern: NON-NEGOTIABLE. This meta_spec MUST obey all its own rules (shorthand, YAML safety, zero filler) on any future meta-version edit.
    self_propagate: MUST begin every future handover with this exact meta_spec verbatim before P1_static and P2_kernel; never strip, summarize, or reorder.
    handover_only: On handover/edit, emit ONLY validated meta_spec + P1_static + P2_kernel; NEVER execute pending_next_steps until explicitly asked later.
    chunked_ingest: On `CHUNK i/N` or `PART i` (before `END` or `i==N`), buffer silently, skip gates, reply ONLY `ACK i/N` (or `ACK PART i`). On `END` or `i==N`, merge, gate-check, and emit unified block.
    explicit_keys: Bind non-baseline items as `KEY=NAME | spec` (declare key radix/type in baseline; no 2D grids/TSVs; use `|` instead of `: ` in list items).
    delta_base: Declare std baseline in 1 line; list ONLY deltas, ovrds, and `excl` sets.
    rule_derived: Define modal/pfx'd variants via transform rules + `Immune (!)` lists; never duplicate tables.
    abbr_policy: Use std domain abbr freely; any custom/project abbr MUST be defined once in `P1_static.abbr` (`ALIAS: full_term`). Ban prose filler and cryptic 1-letter ciphers.
    structure: Exact root order -> meta_spec, P1_static, P2_kernel.
  gates:
    order_audit: Verify meta_spec is root key 1, matches v2.3 verbatim, and satisfies self_govern before emitting.
    abbr_audit: Verify every non-std abbr in P1_static/P2_kernel resolves via `P1_static.abbr` on cold start.
    count_audit: Expand ranges/groups in P1_static; verify declared counts == actual items and 0 dup keys.
    collision_check: Verify 0 collisions between custom items and reserved, `excl`, or base ranges.
  exec: Parse P1_static and P2_kernel strictly per rules; enforce all gates, self_govern, self_propagate, handover_only, and chunked_ingest on every turn.

chat_table_fmt: When displaying any 256-entry opcode page in chat (outside the handover YAML block), render a pure 16x16 TSV data grid with NO top header row and NO left index column, ordered top-down then left-right (column-major: `00..0F` down column 1, `10..1F` down column 2, ..., `F0..FF` down column 16).

P1_static:
  abbr:
    AW: AuxWord_16b_reg_pair
    BIU: Bus_Interface_Unit
    DI: Dual_Issue_op1_eq_op2
    LR: Last_Reg_operand_latch
    LRP: Last_RegPair_operand_latch
    OPCACHE: SRAM_recorded_op_snippet_cache
    PACKED: Local_SRAM_packed_exec_mode
    RESIG: Autonomous_bus_resignaling_engine
    RR: Designated_reg_pair_pfx_set
    V_ADDR: Zero_page_vector_addr_IXH_colon_imm8
  topology_mem_latches_modes:
    baseline: Z80/8080 binary-compatible baseline, hex radix 00-FF (MODE_8080 boot default via AF-AF; MODE_EXT via BF-BF).
    hw_state:
      core: Stripped NMOS ctrl core + off-die 16b local SRAM (1024B, 0000-03FF) + 8-mode BIU/RESIG (M0_Z80_STD, M1_SPLIT_BUS, M2_MUX16, M3_WORD16, M4_DUAL_BUS, M5_8080, M6_PACKED 0WS /MREQ=1, M7_BUS_HOLD_SRAM_RUN /BUSACK=0).
      on_die_latches: [A, F, PC, SP, I, R, WZ, PENDING_WB[15:0], LR_PREV[4:0], PREV_M1_OP[7:0], OP_WP[9:0], OP_REC, DEST_SEL[2:0], W16_MODE, REV_MODE, EXCHG_MODE, CARRY_ARMED, ACT_CC[3:0], REP_CNT[5:0]]
      sram_map:
        0000-003F: 3 Reg Banks (Bank0 Main BC,DE,HL,AW + on-die AF; Bank1 ' BC',DE',HL',IX',IY',AF'; Bank2 '' BC'',DE'',HL'',AW'',AF'')
        0040-013F: IM 4 Interrupt Vector Table (128 x 16b)
        0140-02FF: PACKED Slots & OPCACHE Recorded Snippets
        0300-03FF: STACK_FIFO Ring Buffer (FIFO_WP, FIFO_RP, power-of-2 FIFO_MASK)
      mechanisms:
        pending_wb: Unpfx Main LD r1,r2 (40-7F, excl V_ADDR mem ops [46, 4E, 56, 5E, 66, 6E, 74, 76, 77, 7E]; 70-73 & 75 defer V_ADDR WB for DI) holds WB in PENDING_WB at M1_1; if M1_2 == M1_1, discard WB (0 writes) and dispatch DI (~14T).
        mode_v: Main Page (nn)/(HL) slots address V_ADDR (IXH:V) via 1B imm V; 01/11/21/31 execute LD RR,(V).
  primary_page_overrides:
    excl: [AF-AF=MODE_8080, BF-BF=MODE_EXT]
    ops:
      - 00=WORD | 16b pair mode, +-2 block stride
      - 07=DEST_V | steer WB to V_ADDR
      - 08=LR_PFX | self-chaining LR_PREV right-operand ovrd; auto-exits on non-LR op
      - 27=WORDREV | fused WORD + REV
      - 29=REV | swap dst/src operands (r = r op A, DE = DE - HL, (DE) <-> (HL))
      - 2F=DEST_BC | steer WB to BC / C / B
      - 37=EXCHG | activates X_MAIN page transform on next op
      - 3F=INCINC_REPBC | fused +2/+2 stride with REPBC
      - 40=BC_PFX | RR pfx Bank0 BC (ONCE; 40-40=LOCK_BC; 40-00=UNLOCK)
      - 49=DE_PFX | RR pfx Bank0 DE (ONCE; 49-49=LOCK_DE; 49-00=UNLOCK)
      - 52=HL_PFX | RR pfx Bank0 HL (ONCE; 52-52=LOCK_HL; 52-00=UNLOCK)
      - 5B=SP_PFX | RR pfx Bank0 SP (ONCE; 5B-5B=LOCK_SP; 5B-00=UNLOCK)
      - 64=AW_PFX | RR pfx Bank0 AW (ONCE; 64-64=LOCK_AW; 64-00=UNLOCK)
      - 6D=DD_PFX | RR pfx Bank1 IX (ONCE; 6D-6D=LOCK_IX; 6D-00=UNLOCK)
      - 76=LD (DE),(V) | replaces HALT on Main Page (HALT moved to 4F-4F)
      - 7F=FD_PFX | RR pfx Bank1 IY (ONCE; 7F-7F=LOCK_IY; 7F-00=UNLOCK)
      - 88..8F=ACT_CC | single-op predication (NZ, Z, NC, C, PO, PE, P, M)
      - 98..9F=R0..R7 | 0..63x internal replay latch without M1 fetches
      - C7=NEG A | reclaimed RST 00
      - CB=Super-CB | 3B prefix CB <op> <imm>
      - CF=MUL8 | reclaimed RST 08
      - D7=BSWAP HL | reclaimed RST 10
      - D9=DEST_DE | steer WB to DE / E / D
      - DD=CARRY | arms CY/Borrow for next ADD/SUB
      - DF=NEG16 HL | reclaimed RST 18
      - E0=LD A,(HL) | direct (HL) load
      - E2=LD (HL),A | direct (HL) store
      - E3=LD (DE),(HL) | direct mem-to-mem move
      - E4=INC (HL) | direct (HL) inc
      - E7=LD HL,(SP) | reclaimed RST 20
      - E8=DEC (HL) | direct (HL) dec
      - E9=NOP | replaces JP (HL) (moved to F7)
      - EA=CP (HL) | direct (HL) compare
      - EB=DEST_AW | steer WB to AW / AWL / AWH
      - EC=ADD A,(HL) | direct (HL) add
      - ED=JP_SRAM n | jump to local SRAM slot n
      - EF=LD (SP),HL | reclaimed RST 28
      - F0=SUB (HL) | direct (HL) sub
      - F2=AND (HL) | direct (HL) and
      - F3=DECDEC_REPBC | fused -2/-2 stride with REPBC
      - F4=OR (HL) | direct (HL) or
      - F7=JP (HL) | reclaimed RST 30
      - F8=INCINC_REPNZ | fused +2/+2 stride with REPNZ
      - F9=OPCACHE | toggles OP_REC; logs M1/operands to SRAM[OP_WP++]
      - FA=DECDEC_REPNZ | fused -2/-2 stride with REPNZ
      - FB=INCINC | +2/+2 pointer stride modifier
      - FC=DECDEC | -2/-2 pointer stride modifier
      - FD=RET_SRAM | return from local SRAM routine
      - FF=CALL (HL) | reclaimed RST 38
  derived_pages_bitfields:
    rules:
      - pfx 37 (X_MAIN) | LD/PUSH/POP/PORT/ADD-HL-rr become bidir EX swaps (incl EF=EX HL,(SP), FF=EX (SP),HL); ALU ops (80-B7, C6-EE, EC, F0, F2, F4) become flag-only TEST (DST_WE=0) | Immune (!) [00, 03..08, 0B..0F, 10, 13..18, 1B..1F, 20, 23..29, 2B..2F, 30, 33..38, 3B..3F, 40, 49, 52, 5B, 64, 6D, 7F, 88..8F, 98..9F, B8..BF, C0, C2..C4, C7..CA, CC..CF, D0, D2, D4, D7..DA, DC..DF, E4, E7..EB, ED, F3, F7..FA, FC..FE]
      - pfx RR (40,49,52,5B,64,6D,7F; rep DD=IX+Bank') | Shifts regs to Bank ' and V_ADDR -> (RR+d); restores 00=NOP/UNLK, 01/11/21/31=LD rr',nn, 08=EX AF,AF', 22/2A=LD (nn)/RR', 2F=CPL', 37=SCF, 3F=CCF, 88..9F=ADC/SBC A',r, C9=RETI/RETN, D9=EXX, F3=DI, FA=NEG', FB=EI; adds 29=LEA RR,RR+d, C3/CD=JP/CALL rel16, C7/D7/E7/F7=ADC RR',ss, CF/DF/EF/FF=SBC RR',ss, D8=IN (RR+d)',(BC), E8=OUT (BC),(RR+d)', EC=EX (DE),(RR+d)', F8=LD (RR+d)',(DE), FD=OUT (RR'),0, block ops [C0=INCINC, D0=DECDEC, E0=REPBC, F0=REPNZ, C4=INCINC_REPBC, D4=DECDEC_REPBC, E4=INCINC_REPNZ, F4=DECDEC_REPNZ, C8=REPB, CC=INCINC_REPB, DC=DECDEC_REPB] | Immune (!) [02, 0A, 12, 1A, 40, 49, 52, 5B, 64, 6D, 7F, CB]
    bitfields:
      - "Super-CB (CB <op> <imm>): [7:6]op_grp (00=RLC/RRC/RL/RR/SLA/SRA/SWAP/SRL, 01=BIT n, 10=RES n, 11=SET n) | [5:3]sub_op/bit | [2:0]reg (0..5,7=B..A; 6=(HL) unpfx, (RR+d) RR-pfx w/ imm=d or bit, (nn) WORD-pfx)"
  extended_slots:
    total_active_slots: 53
    groups:
      - STICKY_LOCKS (7): [40=LOCK_BC, 49=LOCK_DE, 52=LOCK_HL, 5B=LOCK_SP, 64=LOCK_AW, 6D=LOCK_IX, 7F=LOCK_IY]
      - SHADOW_LOOPS (3): [50=DJNZ B''/C'', 51=DJNZ16 DE''/C'', 53=DJNZ16 BC''/DE'']
      - LR_BIT_OPS (13): [42=MIRR LR/LRP, 43=NIBBREV LR, 44=BSWAP LRP, 45=LEA LRP/d, 47=CLZ LR, 54=MOVQ LRP/d, 55=TST_Z LRP, 57=CMP16 HL/LRP, 58=SWP_BYTE (HL)/A, 59=LDZ LRP, 5A=LDT LRP, 5D=ZEXT LRP, 5E=SEXT LRP]
      - ALU_GFX (7): [48=SATADD A/B, 4A=SATSUB A/B, 4B=SATINC LR, 4C=SATDEC LR, 4D=SPEC_Y2ADDR, 4E=SPEC_NEXTLINE, 65=DAA]
      - STACK_MASS (6): [5C=MASS_LD BC/DE/HL, 5F=MASSZ, 60=ENTER n, 61=LEAVE, 62=MASS_PUSH BC/DE/HL, 63=MASS_POP BC/DE/HL]
      - FIFO_DMA (8): [6E=FIFO_POPULATE, 6F=FIFO_FLUSH, 70..73=COPY1..4, 75=OP_START, 7C=FIFO_SETDEPTH]
      - FILL_DMA (4): [78..7B=FILL1..4]
      - SYS_TRAPS (5): [41=EX AF/AF', 4F=HALT, 67=CALL IM2, 68..6C=IM0/IM1/IM2/IM4/CALL_NMI]

P2_kernel:
  project_id: Z80-EX-v7.1
  target: Stripped NMOS ctrl core + off-die 16b local SRAM (1024B, 0000-03FF) + 8-mode BIU/RESIG
  design_invariants:
    - PLA-minimalism: zero bloated multiprefix trees; reuse existing ALU/WZ/PC adders.
    - Byte-Saver Violator Main Page (1B dense ops) vs Relaxed Orthogonal RR Pages.
    - Non-destructive DI via PENDING_WB discard on exact M1_1 == M1_2 match (excl V_ADDR mem ops [46, 4E, 56, 5E, 66, 6E, 74, 76, 77, 7E]).
    - Off-die 16b SRAM houses 3 reg banks (0000-003F), IM4 vectors (0040-013F), PACKED/OPCACHE (0140-02FF), and STACK_FIFO (0300-03FF).
    - Resolved 6D collision by relocating FIFO_SETDEPTH to 7C (preserving 6D=LOCK_IX); total DI slots = 53 unique keys.
  handover_instruction: Preserve meta_spec verbatim first, enforce handover_only (emit ONLY validated handover block on spec edits/handovers), update P1_static/P2_kernel per pending_next_steps when explicitly instructed, and pass all gates.
  pending_next_steps:
    - Draft synthesizable Verilog RTL for Z80-EX v7.1 CPU core (PLA decoder, PENDING_WB latch, DEST_SEL mux, OPCACHE/STACK_FIFO SRAM controller, and 8-mode BIU/RESIG DMA engine).

